]{name=title, column=1, span=2, between=top and row3}{
  {\fontsize{56}{66}\selectfont\bfseries\color{white} The State of Global Education}\\[10pt]
  {\fontsize{28}{34}\selectfont\color{accent} Progress, Gaps, and Inequality}\\[8pt]
  {\fontsize{18}{24}\selectfont\color{textlight} A data-driven look at how education access, quality, and equity have evolved worldwide}
}

% ═══════════════════════════════════════════
